# "Exile target nonland permanent. You lose 3 life." (CR 701.13a, 119.3, 115.1). On turn 3 Bot1 casts it at Bot2's
# Ornithopter and Bot2 answers with Lightning Bolt on its own Ornithopter: the target is illegal as the spell tries to
# resolve, so it does not resolve and Bot1 stays at 20 (Scryfall's ruling). On turn 5 it exiles Bot1's own Mox Ruby and
# on turn 7 Bot2's Mox Sapphire, each losing exactly 3 life - 17 and then 14. A land is no legal target (the refusal).

